lists Rabao/Rudolfo/onTrigger Rabao/Rudolfo/onTrade Rabao/Zoriboh/onTrigger Norg/Sohyon/onTrigger Norg/Washu/onTrigger Norg/Gimb/onTrigger KorrolokaTunnel/_4t0/onTrigger PortBastok/Kagetora/onTrigger PortBastok/Patient_Wheel/onTrigger PortBastok/Patient_Wheel/onTrade Selbina/Abelard/onTrigger LufaiseMeadows/onZoneIn/1 Rabao/onEventFinish/121
